-- V7 F2 composed profile foreign keys (ADR-V7-02): every native FK between profile
-- scoped tables also carries (workspace_id[,environment]), so a cross-profile or
-- cross-environment reference is rejected natively, even by an owner that bypasses
-- row policies. Body generated by planProfileForeignKeys over the 0001-0097
-- catalog with commerceProfileForeignKeyPolicy; tests/integration/
-- profile-composed-foreign-keys.test.ts requires byte equality with the planner.
-- Old constraints, actions and rows are preserved; crossed history aborts.
-- Local proposal only: preserve every old constraint and row.
